<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<glyph name="ampersand" format="2">
  <advance width="754"/>
  <unicode hex="0026"/>
  <note>
Individually drawn ampersand; upper loop, diagonal ribbon and open crossing kept distinct.
Weight master: 正文中粗：竖茎 108、横画 94，比 Regular 暗一档，但横画追得更快，对比下降。B 上碗开始收、下碗保持，腰轻收。M 谷加深而不是简单加粗。字距略紧。
</note>
